; Cooler's bonus fight in the ten-day wait (docs/story.md section 0 item 8, "Side quests in the wait"),
; applied by ch8_cooler.json. The Piccolo gates stay as they are (zone 4 area 50 behind the Triceratops
; Jungle, flag 60 from chapter 2; zone 6 area 61 behind area 62's barrier); in co-op Cooler (stat 29)
; fights beside his Namekian servant (bosses.c: sprite 166, stat 113, both-down), introduced here: a
; Namekian warrior Frieza's family took from Namek and Cooler kept. The three stock openings (Goku,
; Trunks, anyone else) meet at one co-op check before the fight; entry 0's returned indexes are restated.
; Speakers: 0 narration (the Namekian has no portrait), 1 the active character, 44 Cooler.

sequence ch8_cooler
  script                                 ; stock entry 0: Goku -> 4, Trunks -> 7, else 1. The players walk up into the view (they were left
        SetPlayerVisible 0               ; below it for the whole opening) and face him 34 px off; Cooler has his back to them and turns
        SetEntityFacing 34, 1
        WalkToPosition 0, 200, 298
        SetEntityFacing 0, 1
        CoopCall 9, 1, 226, 302
        PanCameraToPosition 100, 214, 2
        WaitFrames 20
        SetEntityFacing 34, 3
        WaitFrames 12
        SetEntityFacing 34, 0
        WaitFrames 20
        PushActiveCharIndex
        PushByte 4
        CmpEq
        JumpIfFalse L1
        PushByte 4
        END
      L1:
        PushActiveCharIndex
        PushByte 3
        CmpEq
        JumpIfFalse L2
        PushByte 7
      L2:
  stock @083d280c                        ; "You're not Goku..."
  stock @083d2858                        ; "He couldn't make it!"
  stock @083d28ac -> 10                  ; "I shall enjoy causing you pain!"
  stock @083d28f4                        ; Goku: "I didn't think you were going to come."
  stock @083d2948
  stock @083d296c -> 10                  ; "Prepare to meet your maker!"
  stock @083d29ee                        ; Trunks: "Who are you?"
  stock @083d2a08
  stock @083d2a78 -> 10                  ; "I'll destroy you!"
  script                                 ; co-op: the servant (next 11), else the fight (16)
        CoopCall 5, 0, 0, 0
        JumpIfFalse L1
        PushByte 11
        END
      L1:
        PushByte 16
        END
  text 44 "COOLER: And you brought a friend?  Then I'll bring mine.\x0bA Namekian warrior my father took from Namek long ago.  He serves me now."
  script                                 ; the servant walks up to the spot his boss twin takes (TWIN_OFFSET right of Cooler), so the swap does not show
        SpawnCharacterEntity 166, 344, 264
        WalkToPosition 166, 224, 264
        SetEntityFacing 166, 0
  text 0 "@^NAMEKIAN: ...As you command, Lord Cooler."
  text 1 "A Namekian...  serving Frieza's family?!"
  script                                 ; [15] his actor makes way for the twin
        DespawnEntity 166
  script                                 ; [16] stock 083d2a98, the fight (Cooler, and his servant in co-op); the HUD back
        DespawnCharacterAndRecordPosition 34, 1
        SetPlayerVisible 1
        DrawBossHealthBar 34
        SetActiveEntity 0
end

; Cooler's end (record 1's defeat script, stock 083fb3c8): the camera goes to him first, so his death is seen wherever the fight
; left the players (it played off screen); the stock script's own pan to the door and SetActiveEntity 0 hand the camera back
script ch8_cooler_death
    PushEntityPosition 34
    PushVarint 65536
    Div
    PushByte 120
    Sub
    PushEntityPosition 34
    PushEntityPosition 34
    PushVarint 65536
    Div
    PushVarint 65536
    Mul
    Sub
    PushByte 96
    Sub
    PushByte 6
    Step PanCameraToPosition
    WhiteFlash 5
    BeginCommandBatch
    ScreenShake 0, 20, 30
    PlaySFX 34, 31
    PlayDamageEffect 34
    PushMulti 34, 10, 10
    Negate
    EntitySetVelocity
    PlaySFX 34, 20
    PushMulti 34, 8
    Negate
    EntitySetVelocity 10
    PlaySFX 34, 21
    PushMulti 34, 4
    Negate
    EntitySetVelocity 16
    CommitCommandBatch
    WaitFrames 20
    BeginCommandBatch
    ScreenShake 0, 20, 30
    PlaySFX 34, 31
    PlayDamageEffect 34
    SetEntityAnimation 34, 2
    PushMulti 34, 16, 16
    Negate
    EntitySetVelocity
    PlaySFX 34, 21
    PushMulti 34, 20, 8
    Negate
    EntitySetVelocity
    PlaySFX 34, 20
    PushMulti 34, 12
    Negate
    PushByte 4
    Negate
    EntitySetVelocity
    CommitCommandBatch
    WaitFrames 20
    BeginCommandBatch
    ScreenShake 0, 20, 40
    PlaySFX 34, 31
    PlayDamageEffect 34
    SetEntityAnimation 34, 2
    PushMulti 34, 10
    Negate
    PushByte 16
    Negate
    EntitySetVelocity
    PlaySFX 34, 20
    EntitySetVelocity 34, 10, 16
    PlaySFX 34, 21
    PushMulti 34, 16
    Negate
    EntitySetVelocity 8
    CommitCommandBatch
    WaitFrames 20
    BeginCommandBatch
    ScreenShake 0, 20, 20
    PlayDamageEffect 34
    SetEntityAnimation 34, 2
    PlaySFX 34, 31
    PushMulti 34, 12
    Negate
    EntitySetVelocity 24
    PlaySFX 34, 20
    PushMulti 34, 0, 24
    Negate
    EntitySetVelocity
    CommitCommandBatch
    WaitFrames 20
    BeginCommandBatch
    ScreenShake 0, 20, 80
    PlayDamageEffect 34
    SetEntityAnimation 34, 2
    PlaySFX 34, 21
    EntitySetVelocity 34, 0, 0
    EntitySetVelocity 34, 16, 16
    PushMulti 34, 16
    Negate
    PushByte 16
    Negate
    EntitySetVelocity
    PushMulti 34, 16, 16
    Negate
    EntitySetVelocity
    PushMulti 34, 16
    Negate
    EntitySetVelocity 16
    CommitCommandBatch
    SpawnMapEntity 0
    DespawnEntity 34
    WaitFrames 80
    FindPlayerEntity
    AddEXP 600000
    PlayMusic 11
    WaitFrames 80
    SetStoryFlag 301
    SetCollisionRect 200, 128, 240, 152
    SetCollisionRect 184, 488, 256, 512
    PanCameraToPosition 100, 48, 3
    WaitFrames 60
    PlayAudio 47
    FindEntityByType 0
    PlayAudio 12
    WaitFrames 60
    SetActiveEntity 0
    END
end
